# Background cuts for scenes/bird.lrc — one palette per lyric cue.
#
#   <seconds>:#top/#bottom/#accent[@nebula,stars,drift]
#
# `top` is the zenith, `bottom` the floor, `accent` colours the nebula band and
# the horizon glow; the three sliders are 0..1 / 0..1 / 0..4.
# Read into `--bg-cut` by the caller (one argument per line), so this file stays
# the single, diff-able source of truth for the PV's colour script.
#
# Mapped 1:1 from the per-cue visual track; each entry picks up where the
# previous one leaves off, hence the cue time rather than a round number.

